{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cfa10jml","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":109.33,"top":593.33,"width":972,"height":305.33},"name":"Introduction text","text":"Diabetes care involves changing clinical measurements, lifestyle records and risk factors. Disconnected observations make it difficult to understand how a patient's health state evolves. This project uses the ShanghaiT2DM longitudinal dataset to build a patient-centric digital representation of health over time, bringing patient records, trends, predictive analytics and medical knowledge into a coherent workflow for healthcare professionals and researchers.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#425865","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3ahk3u54","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":109.33,"top":1053.33,"width":972,"height":116},"name":"Problem statement","text":"Patient records, risk factors and simulated outcomes need a connected, interpretable view that clearly separates observed health information from model-generated estimates.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":29.33,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#425865","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/298ju94j","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":109.33,"top":1186.67,"width":972,"height":41.33},"name":"Aim label","text":"Project aim","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7545AB","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/pcz254na","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":109.33,"top":1238.67,"width":972,"height":164},"name":"Project aim text","text":"Develop an integrated, patient-centric digital twin that represents changing diabetes health states and connects longitudinal history, risk assessment, explainability, personalised insights, scenario exploration and reporting in one complete workflow.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#103B45","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4bq1wzmp","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":109.33,"top":1413.33,"width":972,"height":41.33},"name":"Objectives label","text":"Research and development objectives","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":29.33,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7545AB","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/f6x0zu58","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":109.33,"top":1456,"width":972,"height":121.33},"name":"Objectives","text":"1. Link longitudinal records to patient-specific state tracking.\n2. Combine prediction, XAI and knowledge-graph context.\n3. Support monitoring, scenario comparison and reporting.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#425865","alignment":"left"}}
